{
  "id": "normal_ending",
  "title": "Normal Ending — The Long Way",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "text": "[The Void Spire falls. Not dramatically — it sags, like something very old and very tired finally giving up.]",
      "portrait": "",
      "next": "line_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_2",
      "speaker": "Kella",
      "text": "We did it.",
      "portrait": "kella_exhausted",
      "next": "line_3"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_3",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "text": "[Somewhere distant, a wolf howls. Not the infected kind. The regular kind, who found something to eat and is announcing it to no one in particular.]",
      "portrait": "",
      "next": "line_4"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_4",
      "speaker": "Kella",
      "text": "Some of them are still out there. The infected. The blight doesn't just... stop.",
      "portrait": "kella_tired",
      "next": "line_5"
    },
    {
      "id": "line_5",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "text": "[She's right. It will take years. Decades, maybe. But the source is gone. For the first time, the ground beneath them is simply ground.]",
      "portrait": "",
      "next": "michael_check"
    },
    {
      "id": "michael_check",
      "type": "branch",
      "conditions": [
        { "flag": "michael_recruited", "goto": "michael_line" }
      ],
      "default": "kella_final"
    },
    {
      "id": "michael_line",
      "speaker": "Michael",
      "text": "So we keep going.",
      "portrait": "michael_steady",
      "next": "kella_response_michael"
    },
    {
      "id": "kella_response_michael",
      "speaker": "Kella",
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "portrait": "kella_quiet",
      "next": "kella_final"
    },
    {
      "id": "kella_final",
      "speaker": "Kella",
      "text": "We keep going.",
      "portrait": "kella_forward",
      "next": "credits"
    },
    {
      "id": "credits",
      "type": "cutscene",
      "cutscene_id": "good_ending_credits",
      "next": "end"
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "end"
    }
  ]
}
